# What git should never pick up in this checkout.
#
# The checkout doubles as the default data root, so everything the server,
# the services, the installer and the tests write at run time lands next to
# the source. Those files hold your memories, your messages, keys and
# credentials. The rules below keep all of it out of `git add`, while the
# source code, tests, documentation and example files stay tracked.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# policy/: signing key, consumed-nonce log, policy events, recall context,
# engagement queue, damping log, re-embed sweep state and their lock files.
# All of it is written at run time. Only policy/.gitignore is source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/policy/*
!/policy/.gitignore
# Named as well, so they stay ignored even if the catch-all above is edited:
# the signing key, the consumed-nonce log and the policy event streams.
policy/distillation-signing-key.json
policy/distillation-state.json
policy/*.lock
policy/policy-events-*.jsonl
consumed-nonces.jsonl

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data the system stores: raw connector rows, ledgers, indexes, telemetry,
# per-connector cursors and hook error logs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
storage/
telemetry/
ledgers/
indices/
hooks/hook-errors.jsonl
hooks/.tmp/
connectors/*/state.json
# The top-level connectors/ directory is cursor and sidecar state. The leading
# slash keeps mcp/lib/connectors/ and mcp/test/connectors/ (source) tracked.
/connectors/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Configuration and credentials that belong to one machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/config/*.json
!/config/*.example.json
/config/secrets.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.session
*.pem
# MCP client registrations name absolute paths on your machine.
.mcp.json
mcp/.mcp.json
# Rendered launchd plists name your checkout and home directory.
/launchd/rendered/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
daemons/logs/
local-embedder/logs/
/logs/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local databases.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite
*.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies, Python environments and model caches.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
mcp/node_modules/
.venv/
local-embedder/.venv/
# Voice-note transcription environment (scripts/stt/).
.venv-stt/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code worktrees and session state (nested git repositories).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backups, operating-system files and editor leftovers.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.r14-backup
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
